{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m5cra54z","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":31,"top":131,"width":461,"height":149},"name":"矩形 7","text":"● 平台：MATLAB + CoppeliaSim 联合仿真。\n● 机械臂：KUKA iiwa 14 R820，七自由度冗余机械臂。\n● 轨迹：测试 4 类焊接轨迹——直线、折线、圆形、L形。\n● 对比：和 9 种算法比较，并测试 5% / 10% 扰动下的鲁棒性。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15.67,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#17233A","alignment":"left"}}
