{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w7ulsvqp","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":61,"top":501,"width":435,"height":26},"name":"矩形 16","text":"对我的方法有什么启发？","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.9,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#0B3EBA","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ja54na9g","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":31,"top":543,"width":461,"height":128},"name":"矩形 17","text":"● CBi-RRT*：先规划全局无碰撞 TCP 路径。\n● ACCP：在焊缝离散点上搜索连续、可执行的关节通道。\n● 可借鉴思想：把“碰撞预测预筛选”加入 ACCP，减少大量精细碰撞检测。\n● 还可借鉴：把位置误差、姿态误差、关节变化、安全距离做成统一评价指标。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15.2,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#17233A","alignment":"left"}}
